Do not invent additional identity-verification requirements unless separately approved.

### 5.24 Discovery experience

Test:

- Nearby discovery.
- Global discovery.
- Trending discovery.
- Feed loading.
- Feed pagination or continuation behavior.
- Filtering.
- Empty feeds.
- Network errors.
- Permission-denied states.
- Authenticated and guest behavior (guest voting/playing per the Guest Session Rule, §5.30).

