### 5.40 User-generated content security

KEA PARROT allows user-generated content.

Test protection against:

- Stored XSS.
- Reflected XSS.
- DOM-based XSS.
- Malicious HTML.
- Script injection.
- Unsafe links.
- Malicious filenames.
- Unexpected markup.
- Content spoofing.
- Abuse of anonymous posting.

All user-generated content must be handled according to the application's approved rendering and sanitization strategy.

